      "encoded": 5376,
      "evidence": "tools/native-abi/probe.generated.c compiled against this version's canonical headers; every bound prototype, struct size, alignment, field offset and field size in this manifest verified by the C compiler, and every by-value aggregate verified at run time through tools/native-abi/valueprobe.generated.c."
    }
